sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant I as Interviewer (model 1)
    participant B as Blackboard (project folder)
    participant P1 as Planner 1 (model 2)
    participant P2 as Planner 2 (model 3)
    participant E as Editor (model 1 or 4)
    participant KE as Knowledge Evaluator
    participant L as Librarian
    participant RO as Research Orchestrator
    participant RA as Research Agents
    participant WV as Wiki Verifier
    participant H as Head Orchestrator
    participant S as Sub-orchestrators
    participant C as Project Critic
    participant PS as Problem Solver 1
    participant F as Final Evaluator
    participant A1 as Auditor 1
    participant A2 as Auditor 2
    participant API as Claude and ChatGPT APIs

    Note over U,B: 1. Intake
    U->>I: Submit task request
    loop Until user is satisfied
        I->>U: Ask questions, propose tasks (Plan A)
        U-->>I: Answers, changes, preliminary approval?
    end
    I->>B: Create project folder, task.txt

    Note over P1,E: 2. Planning loop
    P1->>B: Critique Plan A, write Plan B
    P2->>B: Pros and cons of both plans
    E->>B: Edit each plan using pros and cons
    P1->>B: Vote
    P2->>B: Vote
    E->>B: Vote
    B-->>KE: Refined plan with tasks and subtasks

    Note over KE,WV: 3. Knowledge loop
    loop Until requested knowledge is present
        KE->>L: Topics and knowledge areas needed
        L-->>KE: Which topics the wikis cover
        opt Topics not covered
            loop Until enough information
                KE->>RO: Missing topics
                RO->>RA: Subtask per topic or subtopic
                RA-->>RO: Documents (Elsevier, NCBI, PMC, catalogs)
                RO->>RO: Approve each document, more research needed?
            end
            RO->>L: Approved documents
            L->>L: Sort into categories
            loop Until additions are accurate
                L->>WV: Wiki additions
                WV-->>L: Accurate or fix needed
            end
            L-->>KE: Wiki updated
            KE->>KE: Requested info present? More knowledge needed?
        end
    end
    KE-->>H: Knowledge approved

    Note over H,S: 4. Production
    H->>B: Read project templates from knowledge base
    H->>S: Delegate tasks
    S-->>H: Subtask outputs
    H->>H: Organize outputs together

    Note over C,PS: 5. Critic loop
    loop Until solutions accepted or second decline
        H->>C: Finished project
        C->>PS: Holes, failures, inefficiencies
        PS-->>C: Suggested solutions
        alt Critic accepts
            C-->>F: Accepted project
        else Critic declines
            PS->>L: Check wiki for relevant topics
            alt Wiki has nothing relevant
                PS->>KE: Run knowledge and research loop again
            end
            PS-->>C: New solutions
        end
    end

    alt Declined again after knowledge loop reactivated
        Note over A1,API: 7. Re-design loop
        A1->>A1: Evaluate successes, failures, causes
        loop Until auditors agree
            A1->>A2: Evaluation
            A2-->>A1: Suggestions
            A1-->>A2: Evaluation of suggestions
        end
        A1->>API: Summary of progress, transcript, suggestions
        loop Until fix decided or cost limit reached
            API->>API: Claude and ChatGPT debate improvements
        end
        API-->>U: Report of the fix for approval
    else Accepted
        Note over F,U: 6. Final evaluation
        F->>F: QA: check all files, test runs
        alt Approved
            F-->>U: Folder with files (possibly by email)
        else Not approved
            F-->>H: Issues found, return to production
        end
    end
